     "<div><div style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:#000000\"><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:#000000\"><div><div><div><div><div style=\"color:#000000;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><div>Dear seewave users,<br><br>A new version of seewave (2.1.8) has been pushed to CRAN.<br><br>Please see the changes listed below.</div><br><div>Thanks to <span style=\"color:#000000;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:#ffffff;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline!important;float:none\"><span style=\"color:#000000;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:#ffffff;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline!important;float:none\"><span style=\"color:#000000;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:#ffffff;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline!important;float:none\"><span style=\"color:#000000;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:#ffffff;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline!important;float:none\"><span style=\"color:#000000;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:#ffffff;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;display:inline!important;float:none\">Pierre Aumond, Guillaume Corbeau, Sylvain Haupert, Andrey Anikin, Yannick Jadoul, Marianna Anichini and Maria A. Wis </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">for their contribution!</span><div style=\"clear:both\"><br></div>Enjoy,<br><br>Jerome<br><br>---</div></div><div><br><div>OTHER CHANGES</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>o TFSD(): a new function to compute the normalized Time and Frequency Second Derivative as described by Aumond et al. (2017). By Pierre Aumond and Guillaume Corbeau.</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>o specprop(): a correction regarding the frequency limits.</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>o spectro(): the argument &#39;noisereduction&#39; now takes a value of 1 or 2 for applying the noise reduction according to the rows (1) or columns (2) of the spectrogram. Inspired by Sylvain Haupert.</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>o spectro(): the argument &#39;cexaxis&#39; now works when &#39;scale=TRUE&#39; and &#39;osc=FALSE&#39;.</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>o spectro() and all functions based on the Fourier transform: &#39;gaussian&#39; and &#39;bartlett&#39; window asymetry fixed when n is even. By Andrey Anikin.</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>o timer(): a correction when the sounds ends with a signal section. By Yannick Jadoul and Marianna Anichini.</div><div>        o timer(): a bug fixed regarding the first element detected is short than &#39;dmin&#39;. By Yannick Jadoul.</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\"> </span>o wf(): faster display. By Maria A. Wis.</div></div></div><div style=\"color:#000000;font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"><br><br></div></div></div><p><br></p></div></div><br></div></div></div>"
